# ─── Build & review artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Screenshots captured during design review. Regenerable, and currently ~15 MB
# — including captures of an earlier design that was scrapped.
.impeccable/review/

# Reference images downloaded from the design catalog. Re-fetchable.
.impeccable/refs/

# Detector cache and decision-page session logs. Machine-local noise.
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/questions/

# Per-machine overrides that intentionally differ from the committed config.
.impeccable/config.local.json

# NOT ignored, and deliberately so:
#   .impeccable/config.json    — shared detector rules the whole project follows
#   .impeccable/design.json    — the design system, read by tooling
#   .impeccable/surfaces/      — the direction contract for index.html
#   .impeccable/cv-source.html — generates Manuel_Frana_CV.pdf

# ─── LaTeX ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Manuel_Frana_CV.tex is the source and IS tracked. The PDF is tracked too,
# because index.html links to it and the deploy has to serve it.
# Everything below is what a local LaTeX run leaves behind.
*.aux
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.toc

# ─── Editors & OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─── Misc ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
